Sometimes I forget about protection run and let myself level up. I
throw daggers and #enhance that skill. I've gotten better results that
way, but inferior AC and opponents that get quickly very hard will make
things difficult very soon. After Sokoban Mine End was way too much. I
usually only wear leather armor if I find that, and only minimal armor
to keep my force bolt failing rate below 10%. I am thinking I probably
should rely on daggers more and use whatever armor is available, even
if that means I can't use spells, until I'll get hold of DSM (which I
haven't gotten yet, not once. Only one time I have found blessed magic
lamp, and that time djinni was out of wishes... other times when I've
